=head1 DESCRIPTION

A structure that defines one treatment in an experiment. A treatment is
a variation of the feature that you are including in the experiment.

=head1 ATTRIBUTES


=head2 Description => Str

The description of the treatment.


=head2 FeatureVariations => L<Paws::Evidently::FeatureToVariationMap>

The feature variation used for this treatment. This is a key-value
pair. The key is the feature name, and the value is the variation name.


